  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">카훗, slido도 좋습니다..<br>영어 단어 암기 어플 클래스카드 이용하셔도 좋아요<br>매칭게임으로 혼자 암기하기 좋고요<br>스피드 게임으로 경쟁 시킬 수도 있습니다..<br>개인 핸드폰 검색해서<br>원소이름<br>원소기호<br>원소의 이용 등을 조사해서<br>간간한 설명과 그림으로 표현해보기<br>활동도 했습니다~</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c823c2b1cda1762d0dcb1fd1e8baba7dd8e422b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c823c2b1cda1762d0dcb1fd1e8baba7dd8e422b\" data-orgin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c58a3cc176d42015904104c8f1032bbd4b7fbc06\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c58a3cc176d42015904104c8f1032bbd4b7fbc06\" data-orgin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7586622f64dfb21e2e05dc05ddb5b5100d66bfd5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7586622f64dfb21e2e05dc05ddb5b5100d66bfd5\" data-orgin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0667f83fa54469315948b198707850fd73fe253\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0667f83fa54469315948b198707850fd73fe253\" data-orgin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9946a433405de